With the motor power off (E-STOP pressed) golden's LockIndexMotorAndDoHomeProcess (csystem.cpp, the G04 path) sends "ST" then "VS0;SP0,0,0,0;" to the Index EVERY pass -- harmless on a Galil, and the Galil route already had a cooldown (AI(W906-INDEXZ-1203) D4). The IDX1203 branch (W906IdxStop, Motor/myGALILmotor.cpp) printed one line per call. Now: the DecStop still runs every time (golden); the line is printed only when the axis was moving (MotionDone()==false before the stop), otherwise one summary per 30 s with the count. No other behaviour change; no line citations point past this function.

o2 build 0 errors; the Index / Galil route / 1203 ctests (10) pass; Debug and release wb_serve rebuilt.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Motor/myGALILmotor.cpp | 19 ++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Motor/myGALILmotor.cpp b/Motor/myGALILmotor.cpp
index 445acc6..76e4816 100644
--- a/Motor/myGALILmotor.cpp
+++ b/Motor/myGALILmotor.cpp
@@ -6570,10 +6570,27 @@ void W906IdxRelease(TMyMotor& m)
 void W906IdxStop(TMyMotor& z, const char* why)                                  // golden "ST" on the Index: decelerate, the next move re-issues
 {
     if (z.Motor == NULL) return;
+    const bool moving = (z.Motor->MotionDone() == false);   //AI(W906-IDX1203) 20261006: only for the log line below
     z.Motor->DecStop();
     z.fCMD = false;
     z.MovFlag = false;
-    std::printf("[IDX1203] %s stop (%s)\n", z.Alias.c_str(), why ? why : "");
+    //AI(W906-IDX1203) 20261006: EastSun 1006「為什麼一直送圖片上的訊號?」-- with the motor power off golden's LockIndexMotorAndDoHomeProcess
+    //  (csystem.cpp, the G04 path) sends "ST" then "VS0;SP0,0,0,0;" to the Index EVERY pass (harmless on a Galil; the Galil route had a
+    //  cooldown, AI(W906-INDEXZ-1203) D4).  The stop itself still runs every time (golden); the stdout line now says so only when the axis
+    //  was moving, else one summary per 30 s with the count.
+    static unsigned long s_idle = 0, s_lastTick = 0;
+    const unsigned long now = (unsigned long)::GetTickCount();
+    if (moving) {
+        std::printf("[IDX1203] %s stop (%s) -- was moving\n", z.Alias.c_str(), why ? why : "");
+    } else {
+        ++s_idle;
+        if (s_lastTick == 0 || now - s_lastTick >= 30000ul) {
+            std::printf("[IDX1203] %s stop (%s) on an idle axis -- %lu such stop(s) in the last %lu s (golden re-sends ST / VS0;SP0 every pass while the motor power is off)\n",
+                        z.Alias.c_str(), why ? why : "", s_idle, s_lastTick == 0 ? 0ul : (now - s_lastTick) / 1000ul);
+            s_idle = 0;
+            s_lastTick = now;
+        }
+    }
 }
 
 int W906IdxJamMot(int motName)
